OL,3,GNEWSADementia podcast wins gold and
OL,4,Asilver awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA podcast that aims to help people
OL,7,Funderstand the impact dementia can have
OL,8,Fon people has won gold and silver at an
OL,9,Faward ceremony.
OL,11,F'The Dementia Perspective', a
OL,12,Fcollaboration between OG Podcasts and
OL,13,FGuernsey Alzheimer's Association, took
OL,14,Fhome the gold prize in the specialist
OL,15,Fcategory at the British Podcast Awards
OL,16,Fat London's O2 Arena.
OL,18,FThe podcast also took home the silver
OL,19,Faward in the health and wellbeing
OL,20,Fcategory.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
